@startuml security-matrix-m24
title Artifact #16: Six-Boundary Security Responsibility & Enforcement Pipeline
skinparam BoxPadding 15
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left

package "Boundary 1: Learner Web (BFF / Client)" as B1 {
    [Learner UI & Route Handlers] as LearnerWeb
    note bottom of LearnerWeb
      Enforcement:
      - Cookie-based session extraction
      - Input bounds validation (e.g. dailyGoalMin in [5..120])
      - 8.0s timeout & graceful circuit-breaker fallback
      - ZERO direct database / AI client calls
    end note
}

package "Boundary 2: Admin Web (BFF / Server Actions)" as B2 {
    [Admin Portal & Server Actions] as AdminWeb
    note bottom of AdminWeb
      Enforcement:
      - Role-based UI view filtering
      - Pre-persistence SoD validation:
        * Creator self-approval -> 403 Forbidden
        * Moderator publish -> 403 Forbidden
        * Admin emergency publish without APPROVED -> 400 Bad Request
    end note
}

package "Boundary 3: Supabase RLS (Database Core)" as B3 {
    [PostgreSQL RLS Engine] as DatabaseRLS
    note bottom of DatabaseRLS
      Ultimate Enforcement:
      - Mandatory independent DB-level security
      - auth.uid() = learner_id enforcement
      - Cross-tenant / cross-user query denial (empty set)
      - Content visibility: published = true for learners
      - Cannot be bypassed by client application code
    end note
}

package "Boundary 4: Privileged Service Role (Operations)" as B4 {
    [Service Role Key Operator] as PrivilegedService
    note bottom of PrivilegedService
      Strict Isolation:
      - N/A for standard learner & admin workflows
      - Restricted strictly to database migrations & seed
      - NEVER loaded in Learner Web environment
    end note
}

package "Boundary 5: AI Server (Stateless Inference)" as B5 {
    [FastAPI T5-small Service] as AIServer
    note bottom of AIServer
      Non-Ownership Isolation:
      - Stateless text correction only
      - Zero direct DB connection strings
      - Authenticates user JWT via JWKS (ES256)
      - FORBIDDEN from writing learner progression
    end note
}

package "Boundary 6: Audit Store (Immutable Ledger)" as B6 {
    [Append-Only AuditLog] as AuditStore
    note bottom of AuditStore
      Audit Responsibility:
      - Captures sensitive admin actions:
        * Emergency publish (with mandatory reason)
        * Role assignments & account suspension
        * Jump assessment lockouts & diagnostic completions
      - Strictly Append-Only (UPDATE/DELETE forbidden)
    end note
}

' Security Data & Enforcement Flows
LearnerWeb --> DatabaseRLS : PostgREST / RPC (with user Bearer JWT)
LearnerWeb --> AIServer : Proxied HTTP POST /v1/gec/correct (forwarded JWT)

AdminWeb --> DatabaseRLS : Prisma TCP (authorized mutations)
AdminWeb --> AuditStore : Emit required AuditLog events upon sensitive ops

PrivilegedService ..> DatabaseRLS : Migration execution (bypasses RLS for schema DDL only)

@enduml
